        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because some of our components include functionality that in some cases may be integrated into more complex ICs, we also face competition from manufacturers of ICs, ASICs and fully-customized ICs, as well as customers who develop their own IC products.",
        "start_character": 17351,
        "end_character": 17603
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001097864-26-000006",
