        "accession_number": "0001097864-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These variables include, but are not limited to, the timeliness with which we can develop new products and technologies, product performance and quality, manufacturing yields and availability of supply, customer service, pricing, industry trends and general economic trends.",
        "start_character": 20021,
        "end_character": 20295
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001097864-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001097864-26-000006-67cb08af7a08f966",
        "accession_number": "0001097864-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also generate revenue, to a much lesser extent, from product development agreements.",
        "start_character": 7494,
        "end_character": 7581
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001097864-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001097864-26-000006-67cb08af7a08f966",
        "accession_number": "0001097864-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We deploy people and capital with the goal of maximizing the return for our research and development investments by targeting innovative products and solutions for high-growth applications that we believe position us to outperform the industry.",
        "start_character": 15920,
        "end_character": 16164
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001097864-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001097864-26-000006-67cb08af7a08f966",
        "accession_number": "0001097864-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our products to direct customers and distributors for ultimate use in a variety of end-products in different end-markets.",
        "start_character": 11788,
        "end_character": 11917
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001097864-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001097864-26-000006-67cb08af7a08f966",
        "accession_number": "0001097864-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The table below sets forth information with respect to the manufacturing facilities we operate either directly or pursuant to joint ventures, the reportable segments that use such facilities, and the approximate gross square footage of each site's building, which includes, among other things, manufacturing, laboratory, warehousing, office, utility, support and unused areas.",
        "start_character": 24048,
        "end_character": 24424
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001097864-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001097864-26-000006-67cb08af7a08f966",
        "accession_number": "0001097864-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To support this, we introduced a career framework tool that helps employees define their career goals, develop the capabilities required to achieve them, and explore internal opportunities aligned with their aspirations.",
        "start_character": 37475,
        "end_character": 37695
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001097864-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001097864-26-000006-67cb08af7a08f966",
        "accession_number": "0001097864-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also have foreign design operations in Belgium, Canada, China, the Czech Republic, Germany, India, Ireland, Israel, Italy, Japan, South Korea, the Philippines, Romania, Singapore, the Slovak Republic, Slovenia, Switzerland, Taiwan and the United Kingdom.",
        "start_character": 23213,
        "end_character": 23470
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001097864-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001097864-26-000006-67cb08af7a08f966",
        "accession_number": "0001097864-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that our compensation philosophy, combined with the career growth and development opportunities we provide, supports longer employee tenure and helps reduce voluntary turnover.",
        "start_character": 37906,
        "end_character": 38093
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001097864-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001097864-26-000006-67cb08af7a08f966",
        "accession_number": "0001097864-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continue to optimize and right-size our manufacturing footprint to align our capacity with our long-term outlook, while focusing on generating efficiencies that result in meaningful gross margin expansion and operating cash flows.",
        "start_character": 2906,
        "end_character": 3139
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001097864-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001097864-26-000006-67cb08af7a08f966",
        "accession_number": "0001097864-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We currently have domestic design operations in Arizona, California, Idaho, New York, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island and Texas.",
